      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the security_client.py file, I need to write code that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Key Management and Encryption. I will use the AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the concrete third-party managed service for this task. The code will include the import of the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3), which is the provider-specific integration code. </thinking>\n",
