    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that integrates with a managed key service for signing or verification. I will choose AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the concrete external provider. The script will include the necessary imports and code to interact with AWS KMS, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
